.TH STRUT 1
.SH NAME
strut \- ship and thruster editor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/strut
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Strut
is a ship and thruster editor.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Edit masses, struts, and thrusters, then space to play. Digits fire thrusters once assigned; z and Z zoom.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B m / s / n / t / v
Edit modes: mass / spring / connector / thruster / move
.TP
.B 0-9
Set next action key; in play fire/break
.TP
.B LMB
Place/edit per mode
.TP
.B RMB
Cycle edit mode
.TP
.B space
Toggle play/edit
.TP
.B c
Center masses
.TP
.B d
Increase drag (play)
.TP
.B z / Z
Zoom in/out
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/strut.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR ode (2),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
